          "finding": "The final theorem gives original U3+U4 <= groupedStateUpper <= groupedSeedUpper+groupedSharpError+epsilon*singularNormalization. It combines J true source domination with the derived state enclosure and paid deterministic corrections. Threshold selection precedes tau, bank and finite rounds. Q varies with the outer prime; the theorem supplies no common-Q marked-family approximation and no pointwise H430 defect."
        },
